@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090


### ─── System ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### List available domains
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/domains


### ─── AE — Adverse Events ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page (100 records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae

###

### Custom page size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page_size=10

###

### Second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page=2&page_size=10

###

### Filter by study
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?study=STUDY-001

###

### Filter by study + site
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?study=STUDY-001&site=SITE-001

###

### Filter by subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?subject=STUDY-001-SITE-001-0039817b

###

### Non-matching filter returns empty data (not an error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?study=DOES_NOT_EXIST


### ─── CM — Concomitant Medications ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cm

###

### Filter by study
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cm?study=STUDY-001&page_size=20

###

### Filter by visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cm?visit=VISIT 1&page_size=10


### ─── DM — Demographics ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dm

###

### Filter by study + site
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dm?study=STUDY-001&site=SITE-001&page_size=20

###

### Filter by subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dm?subject=STUDY-001-SITE-001-0039817b


### ─── LB — Laboratory Results ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lb

###

### Filter by study
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lb?study=STUDY-001&page_size=20

###

### Filter by visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lb?visit=VISIT 1&page_size=10


### ─── TV — Trial Visits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tv

###

### Filter by study
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tv?study=STUDY-001&page_size=20

###

### Filter by visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tv?visit=VISIT 1&page_size=10


### ─── VS — Vital Signs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vs

###

### Filter by study
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vs?study=STUDY-001&page_size=20

###

### Filter by subject + visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vs?subject=STUDY-001-SITE-001-0039817b&visit=VISIT 1


### ─── Pagination edge cases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Page beyond total — returns empty data array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page=999999

###

### Maximum allowed page_size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page_size=1000

###

### Invalid page (0) — returns 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page=0

###

### page_size exceeds maximum (1000) — returns 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ae?page_size=9999
